# Paradox.ai

## About


Paradox is a conversational AI platform that automates recruiting, hiring, and onboarding tasks. Its flagship AI assistant, Olivia, engages with candidates 24/7 to answer questions, screen for qualifications, schedule interviews, and deliver a seamless candidate experience. By handling administrative work, Paradox frees up HR teams, giving recruiters and talent leaders more time to focus on strategic initiatives and spend less time with software and more time with people. The platform integrates with major HR systems like Workday, SAP, and Oracle, supporting the entire talent lifecycle — from career site engagement to new hire onboarding.

## Products & Services

### Core Platform
- Conversational ATS is a next‑generation applicant tracking system that automates repetitive steps like screening, scheduling, and feedback collection.
- Conversational Career Sites delivers mobile-first, AI-powered experiences that help candidates discover and apply to jobs quickly, with personalized guidance from a built-in assistant.
- Conversational Scheduling automates interview coordination by using AI to instantly find and confirm mutually available times across multiple participants and time zones, eliminating manual scheduling tasks.
- Conversational Apply transforms any job application into a simple, mobile-first conversation, allowing candidates to apply in minutes via text, web, or WhatsApp. This approach dramatically increases applicant conversion by eliminating lengthy forms and logins, making it easy to apply from any device.
- Conversational CRM enables recruiters to nurture and engage passive candidates through automated SMS and email campaigns, rediscover past applicants, and build talent pipelines.
- Paradox’s Conversational Events platform automates recruiting event management by engaging candidates in real time, enabling seamless registration, reminders, and follow-up communications through AI-powered conversations.


